# Copy this file to .env and fill in your domain to make the lobby and
# every game session reachable through a reverse proxy with SSL (e.g.
# Nginx Proxy Manager), instead of the default LAN-only "same host,
# different port" scheme. Leave unset/empty for LAN-only play - nothing
# else needs to change.
#
# When set, requires ten NPM proxy hosts (one per port), each with
# "Websockets Support" enabled, all pointed at this Docker host's LAN IP:
#
#   <domain>                4000  (frontend)
#   terran.<domain>         4001  terran-audio.<domain>   4002  terran-status.<domain>   4003
#   protoss.<domain>        4004  protoss-audio.<domain>  4005  protoss-status.<domain>  4006
#   zerg.<domain>           4007  zerg-audio.<domain>     4008  zerg-status.<domain>     4009
#
# See README.md's "Reverse proxy / public domain" section for details.
PUBLIC_DOMAIN=
